{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05846","headline":"与胡居士皆病寄此诗兼示学人二首 二 · 王维","name":"与胡居士皆病寄此诗兼示学人二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮空徒漫漫，泛有定悠悠。\n无乘及乘者，所谓智人舟。\n讵舍贫病域，不疲生死流。\n无烦君喻马，任以我爲牛。\n植福祠迦叶，求仁笑孔丘。\n何津不鼓櫂，何路不摧輈。\n念此闻思者，胡爲多阻修。\n空虚花聚散，烦恼树稀稠。\n灭相成无记，生心坐有求。\n降吴复归蜀，不到莫相尤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}